  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Candlelight Youth Training and Employment Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will target 180 unemployed male and female youth between 18 35 years in Togdheer and Sanaag regions. The selected beneficiaries will receive different training courses, tools, safety materials and startup kit. After intensive training they will be placed to secure employment from employers while others will start business</narrative>
  </description>
